d-2025\">here</a> are details on how to use it)</p></li></ul><p>Also, the weekly stock performance can be found <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/weekly-stock-performance-tracker\">here</a>; this should be read alongside the Weekly.</p><div><hr></div><h2><strong>🤝 Community &amp; Extras</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard\">Referral Rewards</a></strong> – The more referrals, the higher the rewards. Ensure to use your personalized link found <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard\">here</a>.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png\" width=\"518\" height=\"175\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&qu